    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 1052 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near Raceland, or 13 miles east of Thibodaux, moving southwest at 20 mph. HAZARD...Winds in excess of 40 mph. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects. Locations impacted include... Houma, Thibodaux, Schriever, Gray, Raceland, Bayou Cane, and Mathews.",
